ials Characterisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise practical exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEM"},{"text":"EDS"},{"text":"XRD"},{"text":"Optical microscopy"},{"text":"Hardness"},{"text":"Tensile testing"},{"text":"DSC"},{"text":"TGA"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Non-Destructive Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful methods include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ultrasonic Testing"},{"text":"Radiographic Testing"},{"text":"Magnetic Particle Testing"},{"text":"Dye Penetrant Testing"},{"text":"Eddy Current Testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"NDT knowledge is especially useful in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aerospace"},{"text":"Oil & gas"},{"text":"Power"},{"text":"Heavy engineering"},{"text":"Manufacturing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Corrosion"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electrochemical corrosion"},{"text":"Galvanic corrosion"},{"text":"Pitting"},{"text":"Crevice corrosion"},{"text":"Stress-corrosion cracking"},{"text":"Corrosion protection"},{"text":"Coatings"},{"text":"Cathodic protection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful knowledge:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ISO 9001"},{"text":"Statistical Process Control"},{"text":"Six Sigma"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"FMEA"},{"text":"8D"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. CAD / Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn according to specialisation:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SolidWorks"},{"text":"CATIA"},{"text":"ANSYS"},{"text":"Abaqus"},{"text":"COMSOL"},{"text":"MATLAB"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For materials R&D, simulation becomes particularly valuable when combined with experimental validation."}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct entry roles"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Relevance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Materials Engineer"},{"text":""}],[{"text":"Junior Materials Engineer"},{"text":""}],[{"text":"Metallurgical Engineer"},{"text":""}],[{"text":"Materials Testi